1
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:16,960
Aren't you afraid

2
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,160
of being punished?

3
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,080
Punished?

4
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:22,960
Growing up,

5
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,040
I've always been the one

6
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,100
punishing others.

7
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,600
I've never been punished by anyone.

8
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,490
You think

9
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,320
you can punish me?

10
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,930
We will gather all the evidence
of your crimes

11
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,200
and bring you to justice.

12
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,080
I can't wait.

13
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,320
I really want to taste

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,730
the feeling of being punished.

15
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,780
Especially by you,

16
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,330
my beautiful

17
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,240
prosecutor.

18
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,600
The video has been authenticated.

19
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,360
It's definitely Wei Feng and Li Ran.

20
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:11,160
This footage was found
on Wei Feng's old computer.

21
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,200
Judging from this clip alone,

22
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,680
Li Ran didn't resist.

23
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,200
Instead, she willingly leaned
into Wei Feng's arms.

24
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,280
The defense attorney
will definitely argue...

25
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,539
Li Ran voluntarily had sex with Wei Feng.

26
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:24,800
The trickiest issue right now is
the timing of the asthma attack.

27
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,080
The forensic doctor said
there's no way to quantify

28
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:28,560
the impact of the sexual assault
stress on her asthma.

29
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,960
Moreover, at the time of the incident,

30
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,920
Li Ran had her asthma medication with her.

31
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,120
Why didn't she use it?

32
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,080
That's what we need to figure out.

33
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:38,280
If Li Ran had the asthma attack
during the sexual assault,

34
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,320
why didn't Wei Feng try to save her?

35
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,120
His current retraction of his confession

36
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,640
is highly likely
because he met with his lawyer.

37
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,800
So I believe

38
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,960
what happened during the sexual assault
caused Li Ran's...

39
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,759
death.

40
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,720
I agree with Wei.

41
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,080
Given the Wei family's power,

42
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,080
if he wasn't the killer,

43
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,840
there was no need for him
to confess in the first place.

44
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,720
But the new evidence
provided by Han Jiatong

45
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,360
has been confirmed by the police.

46
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:59,160
Wei Feng did transfer money
to Li Ran over a long period.

47
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,440
There were financial transactions
between them.

48
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,440
If they weren't lovers,

49
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:04,700
why would he give her money for no reason?

50
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:05,820
One more thing.

51
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,240
If Li Ran died during the sexual

52
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,160
assault,

53
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,639
then

54
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,640
Wei Feng's shift from having sex
to dismemberment

55
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,680
was way

56
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,160
too fast.

57
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,320
If Li Ran

58
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,920
didn't die from the sexual assault,

59
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,720
then Wei Feng

60
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:20,840
wouldn't have needed
to take such a huge risk,

61
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,570
to dismember

62
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:22,760
and dump the body.

63
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,880
Such extreme behavior means

64
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,810
he either feared leaving evidence

65
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,520
or planned to silence her.

66
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,440
But based on current clues,

67
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,360
premeditated murder

68
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,890
can basically be ruled out.

69
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:36,120
The chain of evidence for the dismemberment
and dumping isn't enough to charge Wei Feng.

70
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,000
I suggest we

71
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:40,640
focus the investigation on
the sexual assault at this stage.

72
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,680
I agree.

73
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,200
The suspect in this case

74
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:45,120
has drawn widespread attention
due to his special

75
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,200
social status.

76
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:49,240
We can't let the Wei family
exploit any loopholes.

77
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,570
Nor can we let the public

78
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,160
think our investigation is sloppy.

79
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,920
I suggest we start

80
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,520
with Li Ran and Wei Feng's
social connections,

81
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,400
coordinate with the police,

82
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,400
and dig deeper.

83
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,240
Speed up the case process.

84
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,880
Li Ran's family is from out of town.

85
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,210
Her mother is disabled.

86
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,960
She only came to Beitan

87
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,820
because of her daughter's death.

88
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:10,960
Hello.

89
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,400
You must be Li Ran's mother.

90
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,410
Yes, I am.

91
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:18,600
We are the prosecutors
handling Li Ran's case.

92
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,360
I'm Fang Wei.

93
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,240
This is the prosecutor's assistant,
Chang Kaixin.

94
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,720
Hello.

95
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,079
Prosecutors,

96
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,220
I was just looking for you.

97
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,380
Let me show you.

98
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,240
I...

99
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:30,120
Be careful.

100
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,120
Quick, quick.

101
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,280
Pick them up.

102
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:32,800
Ran...

103
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,000
Don't worry, take your time.

104
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,079
Let me help you.

105
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,320
I'm telling you,

106
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:38,000
our Ran was a good girl.

107
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,120
She wasn't a homewrecker.

108
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:39,640
Look,

109
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,760
these are all the awards
she won since childhood.

110
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,960
She really was a good girl.

111
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,320
She wasn't a homewrecker.

112
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,120
Prosecutors,

113
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,360
you must get justice for her.

114
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,000
She's really a good girl.

115
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,240
Please,

116
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,160
I mean it.

117
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:51,800
Look.

118
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:53,880
By the way,

119
00:03:54,079 --> 00:03:54,520
Ms. Xue,

120
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,920
where were you heading just now?

121
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,520
I was just on my way
to the prosecutor's office.

122
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,040
Officers,

123
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,200
look.

124
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:01,760
Look.

125
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:02,800
It's this vixen

126
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,200
who seduced my son.

127
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,860
They all say my daughter
seduced a rich man's son

128
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,720
and brought this upon herself.

129
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,160
But you saw it just now.

130
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,920
She's not that kind of person.

131
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,040
She's been sweet
and sensible since childhood.

132
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:13,700
And filial,

133
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,420
really.

134
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,120
Ms. Xue,

135
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:18,800
Please take care of yourself.

136
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,730
Don't be too sad.

137
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,079
Right now, this case

138
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,240
is still being handled
according to the law.

139
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,240
Please don't worry.

140
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,840
We will definitely get
justice for the victim.

141
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:26,960
Thank you.

142
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,080
Ms. Xue,

143
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:31,080
you mentioned earlier
that Li Ran was prone to allergies.

144
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,520
We'd like to know more

145
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,050
about her allergy history.

146
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,840
Ran had been allergic to many things
since she was little.

147
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,520
Because she also had asthma,

148
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,040
she was always extra careful.

149
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:45,000
I always reminded her
to take her medicine.

150
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,680
Are all of these

151
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,280
yours?

152
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,440
Ran bought all these for me.

153
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,680
I don't know much about them.

154
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:04,520
Do you know how much Li Ran makes a month?

155
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,160
I don't.

156
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,040
After your husband's car accident in 2016,

157
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,770
your family was in a lot of debt.

158
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,640
Li Ran was still in school at the time.

159
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,480
After 2021,

160
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,760
the debt was suddenly paid off.

161
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,660
Why is that?

162
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,480
Officers,

163
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,640
are you suspecting Ran too?

164
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,360
We may be poor,

165
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,480
but we have our pride.

166
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,720
We don't try to climb the social ladder.

167
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,520
We are honest people.

168
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:27,960
Ms. Xue,

169
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,700
Ms. Xue, please calm down.

170
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,880
We're just asking some questions

171
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,540
to understand the situation.

172
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,920
That bottle of vitamins is imported

173
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,320
and quite expensive.

174
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,000
Li Ran was still in school,

175
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,880
and your hospital bills
were a big expense.

176
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,700
Where did the money come from?

177
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,520
It was funded by a foundation.

178
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,800
They were willing to help me

179
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,800
because Ran had good grades.

180
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:55,040
There are still many good people
in this world.

181
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,240
Are you talking about

182
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,960
the Weilai Foundation?

183
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,200
I don't know its name.

184
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,320
It's just a charity foundation anyway.

185
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,520
Did your daughter send you money often

186
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,050
after she started working?

187
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,640
Any clues you provide now

188
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,080
will help us find the truth.

189
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,800
She did send me money.

190
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,000
But I haven't touched it.

191
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,880
I'm saving it all for her.

192
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:24,130
I don't even know how much there is.

193
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:27,880
Wei,

194
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,720
we're just here to verify
some facts today.

195
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:33,800
Won't questioning them like this
trigger the victim's family?

196
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,730
I only asked necessary questions.

197
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,520
There's no triggering involved.

198
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,600
But the office encourages us
to step away from the files

199
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,880
and do more field visits.

200
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:43,409
Isn't this way of questioning
a bit too blunt?

201
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:48,000
Do you think there's a problem
with my questioning style?

202
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,600
Not exactly.

203
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,560
I just feel

204
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,890
it could be a bit more...

205
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:53,960
tactful.

206
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,000
Being tactful is Ms. Xu's style.

207
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,520
I am me, and she is she.

208
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:01,360
Oh.

209
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,320
Where's our next stop?

210
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:05,920
Thank you.

211
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,760
Hello, Mr. Wei.

212
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,140
Prosecutor Xu.

213
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,240
Come on in.

214
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,880
Thanks for your hard work.

215
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,010
Please, have a seat.

216
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:19,600
I'm Xu Yishan, a prosecutor from
the Beitan Municipal Procuratorate.

217
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,240
This is my clerk,

218
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,120
Zhou Yan.

219
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,560
This is all part of our
case-handling procedure.

220
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,760
I hope you don't mind.

221
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,920
Please, go ahead.

222
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,600
I've heard so much about you.

223
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,600
Come, have a seat.

224
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:32,820
Chairman Wei prepared this tea
especially for you two.

225
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,360
You're too kind.

226
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,440
You must try it.

227
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,460
Sorry for the trouble.

228
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,040
I'll have to trouble you a lot

229
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,280
with my son's matter.

230
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,080
Actually, we came today

231
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:47,000
to ask you about Wei Feng's situation.

232
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,600
Feng?

233
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:53,920
He's been a very kind kid
since he was little.

234
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,400
It's just that

235
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,600
he trusts people too easily.

236
00:07:59,240 --> 00:07:59,880
Look.

237
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,160
These are the letters

238
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,160
Li Ran sent me.

239
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,800
From the age of 16

240
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,840
until now,

241
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,010
she's sent 35 letters in total.

242
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,080
These letters

243
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,600
are all reporting her grades

244
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,000
and thanking you
for your financial support.

245
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,480
Yes.

246
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,690
I've sponsored many students before.

247
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,679
Most of them

248
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,409
have very strong self-esteem.

249
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,120
They generally don't want
to face their sponsors.

250
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,280
It's really rare to see

251
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,480
someone like Li Ran

252
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,850
who keeps writing thank-you letters.

253
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,880
Look at this photo.

254
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:51,970
She sent it to me
on her own initiative when she was 18.

255
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,280
Beitan Business School.

256
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,880
With Li Ran's grades,

257
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,680
it's a bit of a waste for her

258
00:08:58,680 --> 00:08:59,680
to go to this university.

259
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,480
She could have gone
to a better university.

260
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,080
But

261
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,240
Beitan Business School
is the only one cooperating

262
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,400
with our group.

263
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:06,320
So,

264
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,160
she came for our group.

265
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,480
Or maybe she came for Feng.

266
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,280
You didn't see

267
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,880
Li Ran's purpose at the time?

268
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,720
I've always treated Li Ran
as my own child.

269
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,180
I didn't expect

270
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,280
her to have so many schemes.

271
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,480
On a side note,

272
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,440
why was Wei Feng dating Han Jiatong

273
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,170
instead of Li Ran back then?

274
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,050
That's the kids' own business.

275
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,280
As a father,

276
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,330
it's not convenient for me
to interfere too much.

277
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,720
My name is Liu Quanbao.

278
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,400
I'm a security guard

279
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:40,200
at Li Ran's residential compound.

280
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,520
I was on the night shift

281
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,840
on the evening of March 7th.

282
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,640
During the police interrogation,

283
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,200
you confessed to taking
one million from a stranger

284
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:49,160
to destroy the compound's surveillance
footage on the day of the crime,

285
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:49,560
right?

286
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,440
Yes.

287
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,720
A stranger gave you so much money.

288
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,600
Didn't you think it might be a crime?

289
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,490
Officer,

290
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,100
that was a million.

291
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,760
I couldn't earn that much

292
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,920
in my whole life.

293
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,770
Besides,

294
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,280
what law could I break

295
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,840
just by deleting
some surveillance footage?

296
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,360
And

297
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:08,640
I didn't know
that would happen that night.

298
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:09,300
Otherwise,

299
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:11,040
I wouldn't have dared to delete it
even if you beat me to death.

300
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,560
This is a crime, you know?

301
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,930
You have no legal awareness at all.

302
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,840
You said you couldn't even tell if
this person was tall, short, fat, thin,

303
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,440
male, or female.

304
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,160
Couldn't you even recognize the voice?

305
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,160
He just

306
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:27,560
held something against
his throat like this

307
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,680
when he spoke.

308
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,080
The voice

309
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,600
sounded weird.

310
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,640
I couldn't tell
if it was a man or a woman.

311
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,600
The money was just placed right there.

312
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,060
Did you see how he got here?

313
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,720
On foot or by car?

314
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,080
He walked to the gate.

315
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,410
I don't know about outside.

316
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Think carefully.

317
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,960
Are there any other details?

318
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,880
Do you have something to say?

319
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,740
Just say it.

320
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,400
You've been with me for so long.

321
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,260
There's no need to hide anything.

322
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,720
Xu, you know me so well.

323
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,420
I just feel like

324
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,330
we're being too friendly to

325
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,040
the suspect's family.

326
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:13,040
What attitude do you think we should have?

327
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:13,880
Impartial

328
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:14,890
and upright.

329
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:16,960
Good words.

330
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,280
I don't disagree.

331
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:21,640
So you think it's inappropriate

332
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,970
that we drank their tea?

333
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,890
A few cups of tea?

334
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,320
Not really.

335
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,240
Zhou Yan,

336
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:29,900
you've been a clerk
for two years now, right?

337
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:30,640
Yes.

338
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,040
I'm a very simple person.

339
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,400
When I started working,

340
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,760
I just wanted a job close to home.

341
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,890
So I can have a stable

342
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,200
and

343
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,480
comfortable life every day.

344
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:41,920
No drive to move up at all?

345
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,200
Not really.

346
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,040
Chang Kaixin is two years
younger than you,

347
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:49,500
and he's already a prosecutor's assistant.

348
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,930
No thoughts on that?

349
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,200
Let him be strong.

350
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,600
I'll just be the breeze
blowing over the hills.

351
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:54,960
Okay.

352
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,610
I hope you can always maintain this

353
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,040
detached composure.

354
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:03,720
Did you have something
you wanted to say to me just now?

355
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,580
I wanted to say,

356
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,640
are we going to keep chatting
like this until we get off work?

357
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:07,880
Let's go.

358
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,410
Move out.

359
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,200
Since August 2021,

360
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,720
Li Ran's mother's hospital bills
have been around 800,000.

361
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,720
Wei Feng's assistant paid all of it.

362
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,680
The transfers stopped in January.

363
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:24,120
But another transfer was made
after Li Ran died.

364
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,980
Wei Feng and Han Jiatong started
dating in May 2020.

365
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,480
A year later, he started
an affair with Li Ran.

366
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,360
The problem is,

367
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,440
Wei Feng doesn't care what
Han Jiatong thinks at all.

368
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:35,040
And we don't know
Han Jiatong's attitude either.

369
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,720
Han Jiatong was close to Li Ran.

370
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,840
She couldn't have not known.

371
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,040
Given the Wei family's power,

372
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,920
she must be deliberately holding back.

373
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,680
The case itself isn't complicated.

374
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:43,440
What's complicated is

375
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,640
that the suspect's family has been
deliberately obstructing us.

376
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:47,800
We must solidify every detail

377
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,480
so it can stand up to scrutiny.

378
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:49,810
Wait.

379
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,280
Check the work group.

380
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:53,640
I am Li Ran's classmate, Gu Xiaoqiu.

381
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,200
I am reporting

382
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,920
Li Ran for academic fraud
using my real name.

383
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,320
She stole others' academic achievements,

384
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,120
and

385
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:02,130
plagiarized

386
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,480
their research data.

387
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,160
Many people in the comments
are cursing Li Ran,

388
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,680
saying she deserved to die.

389
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,200
Yishan,

390
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:11,280
can we ask Prosecutor Qiao to keep
an eye on the public opinion too?

391
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:14,080
Information spreads too fast
in the new media era.

392
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:14,960
How about this.

393
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,490
I'll figure something out.

394
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,360
Reporting Li Ran with my real name.

395
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,520
I'm her high school classmate.

396
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:22,480
I can testify she really is
this kind of person.

397
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:24,140
She also bullied classmates.

398
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:25,360
This woman

399
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,520
looks treacherous.

400
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:28,160
Looks reflect the heart.

401
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:30,490
You judge Li Ran without even knowing her.

402
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,000
Not everyone is vain.

403
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,040
Do you know how much pressure

404
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:35,280
and grievance she suffered?

405
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:38,480
Transfer that money to the
designated card immediately.

406
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,120
What's wrong, Mr. Li?

407
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,560
Is there a problem with the
financial statement expenses?

408
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:43,760
It's nothing.

409
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,920
You really can't judge a book
by its cover.

410
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:49,400
Li Ran usually seemed so quiet,

411
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,560
yet she caused such a huge storm.

412
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,000
Indeed.

413
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,460
I didn't expect her to be
this kind of person.

414
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,600
Aren't you her college classmate?

415
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:58,680
Tell me,

416
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:00,080
is it true

417
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,570
about Li Ran and Mr. Wei?

418
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:04,520
Could they really keep it from
his wife all this time?

419
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,160
Well,

420
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:06,860
it's hard for me to say.

421
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,560
I'm not that close to her.

422
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,560
Mengqiao,

423
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:10,520
come here for a sec.

424
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:10,960
Okay.

425
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:15,960
Now look,

426
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,040
I've become an academic tyrant.

427
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,170
I don't have that kind of power.

428
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:21,520
Are you saying

429
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,010
Gu Xiaoqiu's report

430
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:23,800
is untrue?

431
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,040
Half and half.

432
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,080
Actually, I haven't
mentored Li Ran for long.

433
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,080
She has a good personality

434
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,880
and is polite.

435
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:33,080
She didn't even want some of the honors,

436
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,140
told me many times.

437
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,480
But the research group

438
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:37,210
is sponsored by Weihong Group.

439
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,040
Wei Feng

440
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,480
specifically came to me and said

441
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,240
if the honor

442
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,580
didn't go to Li Ran,

443
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:42,440
he would cut

444
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,120
next year's budget in half.

445
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:44,880
There are also reports

446
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:47,560
saying Li Ran and Wei Feng
have an unclear relationship.

447
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,120
What do you think about this?

448
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:49,760
Well,

449
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,020
I can't really judge that.

450
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,020
But based on

451
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,360
what I know about Li Ran...

452
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:56,560
I think someone is trying to set the pace

453
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,420
and ruin Li Ran.

454
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,890
You are Li Ran's mother.

455
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:05,680
Who are you?

456
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,520
It doesn't matter who we are.

457
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,320
Do you know what your daughter did?

458
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,520
None of your business.

459
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,720
None of our business?

460
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,080
Li Ran

461
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,320
hooks up with rich boys

462
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:17,840
at school

463
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,240
and acts like a bully.

464
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,280
We

465
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:22,320
are here to deliver justice,

466
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:22,920
got it?

467
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:23,920
Nonsense.

468
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,010
She's not like that.

469
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,200
If you keep talking nonsense,

470
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,060
I'll fight you!

471
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,360
Fight us?

472
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:32,240
You're just a cripple.

473
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:34,040
Take care of yourself first.

474
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:38,760
You...

475
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,170
Give it back!

476
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,280
You bastard!

477
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:44,080
Do you know why you're a cripple?

478
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,960
It's karma.

479
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,200
Like mother,

480
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,760
like daughter.

481
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,000
You bastard!

482
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,320
I'll fight you!

483
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,250
Let's go.

484
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:01,640
Li Ran

485
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:04,800
is the most shameless nepo baby
in our research group.

486
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,000
Watch your language.

487
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,380
Take your time.

488
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,480
Everyone in our group

489
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,440
is a grad student.

490
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,900
She's the only undergrad.

491
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,160
She's never even around.

492
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:18,320
Yet we have to share all our resources

493
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,240
with her.

494
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:23,040
She uses our group's resources
to enter competitions outside.

495
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:25,100
She even won an international award.

496
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:28,160
Then why did Li Ran
get all these resources?

497
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:31,540
Mr. Wei told everyone to look out for her.

498
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:32,880
But she just used it

499
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,720
to boss everyone around.

500
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,840
Everyone was angry
but didn't dare to speak up.

501
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:37,680
If so,

502
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,480
why choose to expose her now?

503
00:16:41,280 --> 00:16:43,360
I can speak up whenever I want.

504
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:45,880
She did something wrong.
Is she afraid of people talking?

505
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,680
She passed away over a month ago.

506
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,120
Isn't your anger a bit late?

507
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:53,980
Gu Xiaoqiu,

508
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:57,320
you made such a big fuss reporting Li Ran
for academic misconduct.

509
00:16:57,320 --> 00:17:00,200
Is it out of justice,
or do you have an ulterior motive?

510
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,640
I don't think I need to say more.
